# Message:
#   New Strategy: CRUSH, causes the AI to mobilize nearly it's entire army for a single front-war, unit AI types are actually converted to Attack City, once crush has expired the AI will automatically replenish it's normal balance of units with newly trained units (so the city attackers can keep momentum going).
#   
#   Added area warplan debug info to chipotle.
#   Reduced the unit value of spearmen.
#   Drill promotion line now synergizes strongly.
#   
#   Units now prefer to join larger groups.
#   Pillagers are now press-ganged into AttackCity groups if they are nearby.
#   Tweaked the way CityAttacker groups decide to merge (more likely to use normal function).
#   Added a AI_moveToStagingCity function which does something not unlike what you would expect.
#   Added function AI_seperateNonAI which removes all UnitAI's from a group not conforming to the passed UnitAI type.
#   Non Attack City units are now booted out of Attack City groups when the group captures a city.
#   
#   With updateBestBuild, Fixed a bug with low production cities. Also increased production priority by era.
